      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 11:01:21 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>This episode of Bloomberg Tech: Europe looks at how technology is reshaping healthcare, with the goal of helping us live longer, healthier lives.
From wearables and continuous blood pressure monitoring to full-body scans, Tom Mackenzie explores how new tools are giving us an unprecedented view inside our bodies.
We ask whether better data, earlier detection and AI can shift medicine from treating illness to preventing it.

"Bloomberg Tech: Europe" spotlights the biggest names and trends shaping the region's technology ecosystem as the global competition heats up. This monthly, 30-minute magazine-style show features in-depth interviews with top technology leaders, as well as major investors and policymakers - giving you a compelling A to Z of the most consequential innovations, opportunities and challenges. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
